faqs:
  - q: "Is AI-generated content bad for SEO?"
    a: "Google does not penalize AI content. It penalizes low-quality content. We use AI to accelerate production, but every piece is reviewed, edited, and optimized by our team. The result is high-quality content at 10x the speed of traditional agencies."
  - q: "How is AI SEO different from regular SEO?"
    a: "The strategy is the same: rank higher, convert more. The execution is faster and more scalable. AI handles research, drafting, and technical audits. Humans handle strategy, editing, and client relationships. You get enterprise-level output without the enterprise price tag."
  - q: "Will AI replace human SEO strategists?"
    a: "No. AI is a force multiplier, not a replacement. It handles the repetitive, data-heavy work so our strategists can focus on what matters: understanding your market, crafting positioning, and making decisions that drive revenue. The agencies that combine AI speed with human judgment will win."
  - q: "How much faster is AI-powered SEO?"
    a: "Our AI workflows produce content 10x faster and run technical audits in minutes instead of days. A competitive analysis that used to take a week now takes hours. The time savings go directly into more content, deeper research, and better results for your business."
  - q: "Do you use AI to mass-produce garbage content?"
    a: "Absolutely not. AI generates first drafts and handles research. Our team reviews, edits, and approves every piece before it goes live. We would rather publish 10 excellent pages than 100 mediocre ones. Quality is non-negotiable."
  - q: "What AI tools do you use?"
    a: "We use a combination of custom AI workflows built on leading language models, proprietary automation pipelines, and industry-standard SEO platforms. The specific tools matter less than the process: AI handles volume, humans handle quality and strategy."
css: |
  .page-hero {
    padding: 160px 0 80px;
    text-align: center;
    position: relative;
    overflow: hidden;
  }
  .page-hero::before {
    content: '';
    position: absolute;
    top: 0; left: 50%;
    transform: translateX(-50%);
    width: 800px; height: 600px;
    background: radial-gradient(circle, rgba(34,211,238,0.12) 0%, transparent 70%);
    pointer-events: none;
  }
  .page-hero h1 {
    font-size: clamp(2.5rem, 6vw, 3.5rem);
    font-weight: 300;
    max-width: 900px;
    margin: 0 auto 24px;
    position: relative; z-index: 1;
  }
  .page-hero p {
    font-size: 1.2rem;
    color: var(--text-muted);
    max-width: 700px;
    margin: 0 auto 40px;
    position: relative; z-index: 1;
    line-height: 1.7;
  }
  .page-hero .btn { position: relative; z-index: 1; }

  .how-section { padding: 8rem 0; }
  .how-section .section-title { font-weight: 300; margin-bottom: 16px; }
  .how-section .section-sub {
    max-width: 720px;
    margin: 0 auto 64px;
    text-align: center;
    color: var(--text-muted);
    font-size: 1.1rem;
    line-height: 1.7;
  }
  .how-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(280px, 1fr));
    gap: 24px;
    max-width: 1000px;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }
  .how-card {
    background: var(--bg-card);
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: 16px;
    padding: 32px;
    transition: all var(--transition);
  }
  .how-card:hover {
    border-color: var(--indigo);
    transform: translateY(-4px);
    box-shadow: 0 12px 40px rgba(79,70,229,0.15);
  }
  .how-card h3 {
    font-size: 1.2rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    margin-bottom: 12px;
  }
  .how-card p {
    color: var(--text-muted);
    line-height: 1.7;
    font-size: 0.95rem;
  }
  .how-number {
    display: inline-block;
    width: 36px; height: 36px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: var(--glow-indigo);
    color: var(--indigo);
    font-weight: 700;
    font-size: 1rem;
    line-height: 36px;
    text-align: center;
    margin-bottom: 16px;
  }

  .dont-section { padding: 8rem 0; }
  .dont-section .section-title { font-weight: 300; margin-bottom: 16px; }
  .dont-section .section-sub {
    max-width: 720px;
    margin: 0 auto 48px;
    text-align: center;
  }
  .dont-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    gap: 32px;
    max-width: 900px;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }
  .dont-col {
    background: var(--bg-card);
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: 16px;
    padding: 32px;
  }
  .dont-col h3 {
    font-size: 1.2rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    margin-bottom: 20px;
  }
  .dont-col ul {
    list-style: none;
    padding: 0;
    margin: 0;
  }
  .dont-col li {
    color: var(--text-muted);
    line-height: 1.7;
    padding: 8px 0;
    padding-left: 28px;
    position: relative;
    font-size: 0.95rem;
  }
  .dont-col li::before {
    position: absolute;
    left: 0;
    font-weight: 700;
  }
  .dont-col.do-col li::before {
    content: '\2713';
    color: var(--green, #22c55e);
  }
  .dont-col.no-col li::before {
    content: '\2717';
    color: var(--red, #ef4444);
  }
  @media (max-width: 768px) {
    .dont-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
  }

  .diff-section { padding: 8rem 0; }
  .diff-section .section-title { font-weight: 300; margin-bottom: 16px; }
  .diff-section .section-sub {
    max-width: 720px;
    margin: 0 auto 48px;
    text-align: center;
    color: var(--text-muted);
    font-size: 1.1rem;
    line-height: 1.7;
  }
  .diff-stats {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
    gap: 32px;
    max-width: 800px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    text-align: center;
  }
  .diff-stat-number {
    font-size: 3rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--indigo);
    display: block;
    margin-bottom: 8px;
  }
  .diff-stat-label {
    color: var(--text-muted);
    font-size: 0.95rem;
  }
  @media (max-width: 768px) {
    .diff-stats { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 24px; }
  }

  .faq-section { padding: 8rem 0; }
  .faq-section .section-title { font-weight: 300; margin-bottom: 48px; }
  .faq-list { max-width: 760px; margin: 0 auto; }
  .faq-item { border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border); }
  .faq-question {
    display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center;
    width: 100%; padding: 24px 0;
    background: none; border: none; color: var(--text);
    font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 600; text-align: left;
    cursor: pointer; gap: 16px;
  }
  .faq-icon {
    flex-shrink: 0; width: 28px; height: 28px;
    border-radius: 50%; background: var(--glow-indigo);
    display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;
    font-size: 1.2rem; transition: transform 0.3s;
  }
  .faq-item.active .faq-icon { transform: rotate(45deg); }
  .faq-answer { max-height: 0; overflow: hidden; transition: max-height 0.3s ease; }
  .faq-answer-inner {
    padding: 0 0 24px; color: var(--text-muted);
    line-height: 1.7; font-size: 1rem;
  }

  .cta-section { padding: 0 0 8rem; }
  .cta-box {
    text-align: center; background: var(--bg-card);
    border: 1px solid var(--border); border-radius: 24px;
    padding: 60px 40px; max-width: 700px; margin: 0 auto;
  }
  .cta-box h2 { font-size: 2rem; font-weight: 300; margin-bottom: 16px; }
  .cta-box p {
    color: var(--text-muted); margin-bottom: 32px;
    font-size: 1.1rem; line-height: 1.6;
  }
